\text{BET} = \sum_{i=1}^{n} (A_i \times \text{EUI}_i) + \text{PL}

i = \text{identifier of a building archetype listed in Table 8.4.4.1. that is associated with a space use of the building}

n = \text{total number of building archetypes listed in Table 8.4.4.1. that are associated with the building}

A_i = \text{gross interior floor area of the building archetype } i \text{, in m}^2\text{, calculated in accordance with Sentence (3)}

\text{EUI}_i = \text{energy use intensity, in kWh/m}^2 \text{ per year, listed in Table 8.4.4.1. for building archetype } i\text{, and}

\text{PL} = \text{annual energy use of the process loads accounted for in the calculation of the annual energy consumption of the proposed building, in excess of the default peak receptacle loads set in Table 8.4.4.2., in kWh per year}
